    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000slue](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000slue) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 35.0 depth occurred on Apr 01 2026 130 km ESE of Bitung, Indonesia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 1.0926 longitude 126.2459. It impacted 1010 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
